      "name": "3. Admin",
      "description": "Admin token from 'Login as admin'. Creates a product, schedules a slot, publishes and closes it, and shows how quotas reserve warehouse stock.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
